# Sci-fi props, kind prop in their OWN file so a template reads only these (the voxel op accepts the kinds char, item, building, prop). D34, owner 2026-11-05: "i wish we had our own scifi in / outside"). New models of kind scifi, drawn from round and box primitives like props.pdl (grid 24, y = depth, front 0, z up).
#   PART | model | part | x | y | z | w | d | h | colour      CYL | model | part | cx | cy | z | radius | height | colour      ELL | model | part | cx | cy | cz | rx | ry | rz | colour
# Names borrow the Soul Pen lore lightly (DOC, not canon, local data only): clone pods (clones are manufactured), the Soul Pen stand, a time beacon (the timeship), a Metal Sun fuel cell, a Centroid terminal, Lunaria lamps. Colours: hull steel #5a6a7a, dark steel #3a4654, glass cyan #4ae0ff, warning amber #ffb040.
